%%{init: {"theme": "base", "themeVariables": {"fontSize": "18px"}}}%%
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor User
    participant CLI as CommandController
    participant Parse as parse_criterion
    participant Manager as PIMManager
    participant Match as Criterion.matches
    User->>CLI: search (type = "task" && deadline < "2026-10-01 09:00")
    CLI->>Parse: parse_criterion(expression)
    Note over Parse: Tokenizer and operator/value stacks build tree
    Parse-->>CLI: validated Criterion tree
    CLI->>Manager: search(criterion)
    loop each PIR in ascending ID order
        Manager->>Match: matches(record)
        Match-->>Manager: bool
    end
    Manager-->>CLI: matching tuple[Record, ...]
    CLI-->>User: ID | type | first text field
    User->>CLI: show ID
    CLI->>Manager: get(record_id)
    Manager-->>CLI: selected Task
    CLI-->>User: id, type, description, deadline
    User->>CLI: update ID description "Revised task"
    CLI->>Manager: update(record_id, field_name, value)
    Note over Manager: dataclasses.replace validates before commit
    Manager-->>CLI: updated Task
    CLI-->>User: Updated ID
